To facilitate compilation, I have created a directory this directory.
On this directory, try using "build-all.tcsh". As the extension indicates,
scripts in this directory using the tcsh shell. If you are using another shell
like bash, you will need to switch to tcsh to execute these scripts:
unix% tcsh
unix% source build-all.tcsh

Note that the environment variable $JIP_HOME is used throughout these scripts.
Make sure that this variable points to the home jip directory one level up
from this directory. If not, edit ../define-jip.tcsh and modify the value.
